OL,3,GNEWSAAward is for fans and Ian Curtis,
OL,4,Asays Peter Hook
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Hook said he would be thrilled to
OL,7,Fpick up the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame
OL,8,Faward later on behalf of Joy Division
OL,9,Fand New Order "for Ian Curtis and for
OL,10,Fall our fans".
OL,12,FThe Salford musician will be in Los
OL,13,FAngeles to receive the accolade. Fellow
OL,14,FManchester band Oasis will also be
OL,15,Finducted but are not expected to attend
OL,16,Fthe ceremony.
OL,18,FJoy Division and New Order have been
OL,19,Fgiven the award jointly - with the late
OL,20,FIan Curtis, Bernard Sumner, Stephen
OL,21,FMorris and Gillian Gilbert being
OL,22,Fhonoured alongside Hook.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
